002500 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
002600 0000-MAIN.
002700     OPEN INPUT EMP-FILE
002800     PERFORM 1000-READ THRU 1000-EXIT
002900     PERFORM UNTIL END-OF-FILE
003000         PERFORM 2000-CALC
003100         PERFORM 1000-READ THRU 1000-EXIT
003200     END-PERFORM
003300     GOBACK.
003400 1000-READ.
003500     READ EMP-FILE INTO WS-EMPLOYEE
003600         AT END SET END-OF-FILE TO TRUE
003700                GO TO 1000-EXIT
